sequenceDiagram
    actor Keeper as "Warehouse Keeper"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Pick as "pickingService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    participant Ship as "shipmentService: Service"
    Keeper->>UI: Open picking list
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/picking-lists/{pickingCode}
    API->>Pick: Load assigned warehouse list
    Pick->>DB: Read expected batch/tag/line quantities
    loop Each batch QR scan
        Keeper->>UI: Scan TEM tag and quantity
        UI->>+API: POST /picking-lists/{code}/scans
        API->>Pick: Validate warehouse, batch, tag, line and quantity
        alt Correct scan
            Pick->>DB: Record scan, split child QR if needed
            API-->>-UI: Scan accepted
        else Mismatch or duplicate
            API-->>-UI: Reject scan
        end
    end
    Keeper->>UI: Complete picking list
    UI->>+API: POST /picking-lists/{code}/complete
    API->>Pick: Mark warehouse portion ready
    Pick->>DB: Save picked quantities and shipment fragment
    UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/shipments/orders/{orderId}/readiness
    API->>Ship: Check every expected warehouse portion and payment gate
    alt All portions ready and prepaid paid
        Keeper->>API: POST /api/v1/shipments/{id}/issue
        API->>Ship: ConfirmIssue with idempotency/version
        Ship->>DB: Decrease OnHand and Reserved once, mark shipment dispatched
        Ship-->>UI: Dispatch recorded
    else Not ready or unpaid
        API-->>-UI: Dispatch blocked
    end



